  "document": "Petrocephalus arnegardi\nPetrocephalus arnegardi is a species of electric fish in the genus \"Petrocephalus\" native to the Central Congo River basin. It is found in middle Congo River and in the Likouala River drainage, in the Democratic Republic of the Congo and Republic of the Congo. It is named after Matthew Arnegard, an expert on elephantfishes."
